  "prefLabel": "Plc 1605.01 Eligibility for Registration Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1605.01 Eligibility for Registration Renewal. To be eligible for renewal of a nurse agency registration, a person shall:\n\n(a) Meet the qualifications stated in Plc 1603.01;\n\n(b) Have paid all administrative and civil penalties imposed, if any; and\n\n(c) Meet the eligibility for renewal criteria specified in Plc 308.02, as applicable.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1600.html"
